# Kanagawa Wave — Ghostty built-in. Theme name is case-sensitive and
# uses a space (not a hyphen). The bundled palette is canonical Wave
# (background #1f1f28, foreground #dcd7ba), so no overrides are needed.
# Active when ~/.config/ghostty/theme.ghostty → this file
# (theme-set kanagawa).
theme = Kanagawa Wave
